        "answer": {
          "short": "$4x+9y=74$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{10-6}{-4-5}\\\\m&=-\\frac49\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $(5,6)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-6&=-\\frac49(x-5)\\\\9y-54&=-4(x-5)\\\\9y-54&=-4x+20\\\\4x+9y&=74\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $4(5)+9(6)=74$ and $4(-4)+9(10)=74$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      },
      {
        "id": "p31-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$(3,4)$ and $(-2,8)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4x+5y=32$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{8-4}{-2-3}\\\\m&=-\\frac45\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $(3,4)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-4&=-\\frac45(x-3)\\\\5y-20&=-4(x-3)\\\\5y-20&=-4x+12\\\\4x+5y&=32\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $4(3)+5(4)=32$ and $4(-2)+5(8)=32$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      },
      {
        "id": "p31-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$(-2,6)$ and $(1,10)$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$4x-3y+26=0$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}m&=\\frac{10-6}{1-(-2)}\\\\m&=\\frac43\\end{align*}$$\nUsing $(-2,6)$:\n$$\\begin{align*}y-6&=\\frac43(x+2)\\\\3y-18&=4(x+2)\\\\3y-18&=4x+8\\\\4x-3y+26&=0\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $4(-2)-3(6)+26=0$ and $4(1)-3(10)+26=0$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
